ame":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"EyhRkmeYUROlV3ZQmhrlRA","review_id":"el6ktzAZsAKmZdOLo6wkpw","date":"2017-01-19T18:54:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9508118629455566,"text_excerpt":"This is pretty cool neighborhood bar. I never would have even known it was here, if I wasn't looking for it- the front of it kind of blends into everything else on the street. The bartender was nice and the people drinking here were as well. It has a lot more space inside than you would ever imagine- if you head to the back there is a whole lounge area with a pool tables and sofas. There's also another sofa right outside the lounge area, which I enjoyed and that was actually clean. Not worth going out of your way, but nice if you are in the area."},{"business_id":"EyhRkmeYUROlV3ZQmhrlRA","review_id":"JffUcGerg92HqldCqHoqSg","date":"2013-03-12T17:30:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9367283582687378,"text_excerpt":"This is a nice, clean neighborhood bar in Mid-City. Great atmosphere, and the bartender was very friendly and knowledgeable. This is a relatively quiet place, and very small. Great for just stopping in and having a drink at the end of a long day. They are open fairly late (it was past 3 a.m. when we went) and the barkeep told us they stay open until people stop drinking or the sun comes up."},{"business_id":"EyhRkmeYUROlV3ZQmhrlRA","review_id":"fYyAZh72xS4eUbIEDC7BFQ","date":"2015-10-07T17:26:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9267410039901733,"text_excerpt":"Very cool neighborhood bar in mid-city. Friendly bartender, good drinks. Decent enough beer selection. Also close to the Lafitte Greenway for easy access."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"EyhRkmeYUROlV3ZQmhrlRA","photo_id":"l3JjIA_fwYWeioNuJGOyzg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/l3JjIA_fwYWeioNuJGOyzg.jpg","visual_re